SUMMARY:Jane Street: All Majors Estimathon®
LOCATION:Friend Center 006
DESCRIPTION:The Estimathon is a mind-bending mixture of math and trivia. 
 In teams\, students will attempt 13 Fermi problems in 30 minutes\, rangi
 ng from totally trivial to positively Putnamesque. Seeking students from
  majors that are traditionally underrepresented in quantitative finance\
 , including biology\, chemistry\, physics\, linguistics and economics. P
 lease Note: Interested in joining? Register through Handshake and comple
 te Jane Street’s Google form. The team will only review Google form su
 bmissions for event participation. The Google form will be linked two we
 eks before the event. Please check back then to complete registration.\n
 Audience: Graduate Students\nRegister: https://princeton.joinhandshake.c
 om/edu/events/2015289\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/ja
 ne-street-all-majors-estimathon%C2%AE-0
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/jane-street-all-majors
 -estimathon%C2%AE-0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
