SUMMARY:Hands-On Policy Analysis with Stata: Difference-in-Differences an
 d Event Study Methods
DESCRIPTION:This workshop provides practical training in conducting diffe
 rence-in-differences (DiD) analyses using Stata for policy evaluation. P
 articipants will learn to implement both classical two-period DiD models
  and modern event study designs to assess policy effects over time. Usin
 g example datasets and step-by-step Stata code\, the session will cover 
 basic DiD estimation\, visualization of event study dynamics\, and key d
 iagnostic checks\, including assessment of parallel trends. The workshop
  is designed for students and researchers interested in causal inference
  and policy evaluation. Basic familiari\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/event
 s/2026/hands-policy-analysis-stata-difference-differences-and-event-stud
