DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions about resumes\, cover letters\, LinkedI
 n\, networking or internship searches? Curious how the Center for Career
  Development supports students? Stop by and talk to Peer Career Advisers
  (PCAs) who are trained by the Center for Career Development - and grab 
 a treat at the Witherspoon Cafe\, on us. The PCAs can answer your questi
 ons and share their experiences from a peer perspective. This program is
  open to all Princeton University undergraduates regardless of identity.
  Email [careerdevelopment@princeton.edu](mailto:careerdevelopment@prince
 ton.edu) to request accommodations at least two weeks prior to the progr
 am.\nRegister: https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/stu/events?collection
