SUMMARY:Thomas Trezise is joined in conversation with André Benhaïm. "B
 eginning Again: A Spouse’s Story of Life after Trauma"
DESCRIPTION:Thomas Trezise is joined in conversation with André Benhaïm
 . "Beginning Again: A Spouse’s Story of Life after Trauma" recounts th
 e struggle to rebuild a life after trauma with emotional clarity and psy
 chological insight. Thomas Trezise\, a professor of French\, was working
  on a book one morning in southern France when his wife\, on a walk in t
 he surrounding countryside\, was sexually assaulted and nearly murdered.
  Here Trezise revisits the challenges of supporting a survivor when his 
 own life was forever changed by the event. He closely examines secondary
  trauma\, in which grief\, fear\, and anger ca\nhttps://www.princeton.ed
