SUMMARY:Repujado: Light\, Shadow & Story
DESCRIPTION:What happens when light becomes part of the artwork?Explore r
 epujado\, a traditional Mexican metal-embossing technique\, through the 
 interplay of surface\, light\, shadow\, and visual storytelling.In this 
 hands-on workshop\, participants will experiment with line\, texture\, p
 attern\, and depth\, discovering how raised and recessed metal surfaces 
