SUMMARY:Site: Exhibition by Carlos Agredano
DESCRIPTION:Recent 2025-26 Hodder Fellow Carlos Agredano showcases new wo
 rk in the exhibition\, Site\, in the Hurley Gallery at the Lewis Arts co
 mplex.Site follows the history of the chemical industry in twentieth-cen
 tury New Jersey\, whose factories supplied pesticides\, plastics\, and m
 unitions to American border enforcement and the United States military. 
 Networks of industrial firms ran from Perth Amboy\, Princeton\, Los Alam
 os\, Bien Hoa\, to Basrah\, and their inventions left behind a toxic leg
 acy both at home and abroad. In response to the negative environmental i
 mpact caused by the chemical industry\, Congre\nhttps://www.princeton.ed
 u/events/2026/site-exhibition-carlos-agredano-11
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/site-exhibition-carlos-agredano
 -11
