SUMMARY:2026 Giving Tuesday
DESCRIPTION:[in conjunction with Tiger Athletics Giving Day (TAGD)]\nCamp
 us Recreation is excited to encourage our Sport Club Friends Groups and 
 TeamRec Staff to consider donating on National Giving Tuesday – Tuesda
 y\, December 1\, 2026. NOTE: These efforts are separate from any challen
 ge through varsity Athletics and winners will be announced in December. 
 Please note that progress and results for these efforts will NOT be part
  of the official TAGD leaderboard that will be visible that day. The mon
 ey raised on this day will support students who are creating community o
 n our campus through their sport club team or their role within Campus R
 ecreation. Our club teams (https://campusrec.princeton.edu/sports/sport-
 clubs) compete locally\, regionally\, and nationally\, and\, even more i
 mportantly\, they create a place for connection through sport and friend
 ships that will last a lifetime. Our TeamRec staff (https://campusrec.pr
 inceton.edu/about-us/student-employment) \nhttps://campusrec.princeton.e
 du/events/2026-giving-tuesday
URL:https://campusrec.princeton.edu/events/2026-giving-tuesday
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
